                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The game is short. The graphics are not the hit but has charme and atmosphere you never find again. I find it a little bit like Slender (you dont get hunt) but its funny. The puzzles and quest are epic, even if it has only some few rooms and see not much its really wow from the beginn to the end 2-3 hours later. Story is not a master piece but fine. All what you see is so wow all little pieces everywhere you can find. The quest are not so easy and the hint system give you only a few helps so it can be you stuck often and need a walktrough but its worth to enjoy this short time of quality. If it would be longer i would give a bit more but so i give 8.0 of 10 you should take a look for the Trailers and Sample Pictures :)",
